@CourierParcelTrackingSystem.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5014

### Get users
GET {{CourierParcelTrackingSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Get customers
GET {{CourierParcelTrackingSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Get hubs
GET {{CourierParcelTrackingSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/hubs
Accept: application/json

### Get parcel statuses
GET {{CourierParcelTrackingSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/parcel-statuses
Accept: application/json

### Get parcels
GET {{CourierParcelTrackingSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/parcels
Accept: application/json
